# Temporary accepted-risk exceptions for CI security gating.
# Review by: 2026-09-30.
#
# Starlette is pulled through FastAPI in Python service images. The fully fixed
# Starlette versions include major compatibility jumps, so this is accepted until
# the FastAPI/Starlette stack is upgraded and tested as a separate change.
CVE-2024-47874
CVE-2026-48818
CVE-2026-54283

# Dockerfile non-root hardening is accepted temporarily because changing runtime
# users can affect Playwright browser installs, local artifact paths, and service
# writable directories. Harden per image after service-level smoke tests exist.
DS-0002

# Kubernetes browser/runtime hardening is accepted temporarily. SYS_ADMIN and
# writable root filesystems are currently tied to browser rendering and legacy
# manifests; remove these ignores after per-service securityContext validation.
KSV-0005
KSV-0014
KSV-0118
